Installing the USB driver (Windows 5.2 SP1, x64)
  Windows' own drivers: UHCI / OHCI yes, EHCI yes, cameras (usbvideo.sys) yes
  controllers: EHCI to USBNT (/ehci)
  oem4.inf (USBNT) removed
  oem5.inf (USBNT) removed
  oem6.inf (USBNT) removed
  usbnt.inf -> C:\WINDOWS\INF\oem4.inf
  usbntkbd.inf -> C:\WINDOWS\INF\oem5.inf
  usbntmou.inf -> C:\WINDOWS\INF\oem6.inf
  IntelRouteToXhci = 1 (Intel chipsets: USB 2.0 ports to xHCI)
  WindowsCamera = 1 (USB cameras go to Windows' usbvideo.sys)
  USBNT device bus installed
  EHCI USBNT USB 1.1 / 2.0 Host Controller (UHCI, OHCI, EHCI) (PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_24CD&SUBSYS_11001AF4&REV_10): usbnt.sys
   USB 2.0 Root Hub (USBNT) (USBNT\ROOT_HUB&VID8086&PID24CD): usbnt.sys
   USB Vendor Specific Device (RTL8153 USB 10/100/1000 Gigabit Ethernet) (USBNT\VID_0BDA&PID_8153&REV_3000): usbnt.sys
Done. Restart Windows to finish.
